to\\mathcal{F}_a^A \\coloneqq \\{X\\in\\mathcal P(A):a\\in X\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}filter\\text{-}family} \\vdash A\\in V\\land a\\in A\\to\\mathcal{F}_a^A \\coloneqq \\{X\\in\\mathcal P(A):a\\in X\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrincipalFilter}(F,a,A) \\leftrightarrow A\\in V\\land a\\in A\\land F=\\{X\\in\\mathcal P(A):a\\in X\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrincipalFilter}(F,a,A) \\leftrightarrow A\\in V\\land a\\in A\\land F=\\{X\\in\\mathcal P(A):a\\in X\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a filter of subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>. It does not call the forcing-poset predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span>, whose signature and semantics are different.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in V$ and $a\\in A$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"te